# =============================================================================
# The build context (TX-4): only what the Dockerfile COPYs --
# pyproject.toml, requirements.lock, app/, alembic.ini, migrations/.
# Everything else stays out: it is not needed, and a context that ships
# .git, the tests or a stray .env into the builder is how secrets and
# weight end up in an image. tests/test_deploy_hardening.py holds both
# lists against each other.
# =============================================================================
.git
.github
.dockerignore
.env
.env.*
**/.env
tests/
deploy/
scripts/
docs/
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
*.md
